    "description": "Cricut & Provo Craft Accessories Lot - 15 Items\nFeatured: 5 Font and Shape Cartridges with Keypads, Cutting Mats, Power Adapter\nThis crafting bundle contains essential accessories designed for Provo Craft Cricut personal electronic cutting systems. The lot provides fonts, shapes, cutting media, and replacement hardware for paper crafting, scrapbooking, and vinyl design.\nIncluded in this Lot: (in value order):\n1.\nGeorge and Basic Shapes Cartridge Set\n(Cricut, cartridge, overlay, booklet, box)\n2.\nPrinting Press Font Cartridge Set\n(Cricut, cartridge, overlay, booklet, box)\n3.\nBeyond Birthdays Shapes Cartridge Set\n(Cricut, cartridge, overlay, booklet, box)\n4.\nNew Arrival Shapes Cartridge Set\n(Cricut, cartridge, overlay, booklet, box)\n5.\nJasmine Font Cartridge Set\n(Cricut, cartridge, overlay, booklet, box)\n6.\nCricut Cutting Mats 2-Pack\n(Cricut Tools, 6x12 inch)\n7.\nAC Power Supply Adapter & Cable\n(Provo Craft, for Personal Electronic Cutter)\n8.\nCuttlebug Fringe Flower 2-Piece Cutting Die Set\n(Provo Craft)\n9.\nCricut Replacement Blades 2-Pack\n(Cricut Tools, carded)\n10.\nCricut Joy 0.4 Fine Point Pens 3-Pack\n(Cricut, Green/Violet/Red)\n11.\nCricut Machine Markers Multi-Pack\n(Provo Craft, 7 markers in pouch)\n12.\nOracal 651 Permanent Adhesive Vinyl\n(Orafol, Gold 12x24 inch)\n13.\nOracal 631 Removable Adhesive Vinyl\n(Orafol, White 12x24 inch)\n14.\nShurtape Crafting Tape Roll\n(Shurtape)\n15.\nCricut Personal Electronic Cutter User Manual & Accessory Plug\n(Provo Craft)\nCondition:\nMixed condition. Cartridge boxes show edge wear, shelf wear, and handwritten ink markings; interior cartridges, overlays, and books are intact. Several accessory packages remain unopened. Only includes what is shown in pictures, any accessories or items not shown but described cannot be guaranteed to be included with the lot.\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE!\nIf you’re happy and you know it, please leave a 5-star rating! If there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to return all messages within one business day.\nPlease click the shipping estimate link in the listing to get the shipping costs directly from FedEx.  There will be no discounts or price changes after an auction has ended.\nOur shipping team works hard to get out all orders as quickly as possible, that being said it may take up to 5 business days after payment for your order to ship out.  Once it ships out you will receive tracking information.\n***IMPORTANT*** If your item was damaged in transit, do not throw away anything, including the box or packing materials until we have authorized you to do so. Photos will be required to file insurance claims.\nOur Business hours: Monday - Friday  8:00 am to 4:00 pm Central\nNew items and unique treasures are added daily, come back soon!",
